					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964656</guid>
				<title>Home is where I want to be</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964656/home-is-where-i-want-to-be</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 20:13:54 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Tyumen</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2951719</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="blockquote"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>Home, is where I want to be</em><br /> <em>But I guess I'm already there</em><br /> <em>I come home, she lifted up her wings</em><br /> <em>I guess that this must be the place</em></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>~David Byrne, &quot;This Must Be the Place&quot;</p> </div> </div> <p>This tale is my attempt at emulating the style of Zyn's original <em>Kiryu Labs</em> series &#8212; probably one of the best early series on this site, propped up by Zyn's talent for writing heartwarming, touching stories with just the right balance between humour and heartfelt emotion. I hope I did Kiryu Labs justice with this.</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5366711&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609273251" alt="VoidLady" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5366711)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" >VoidLady</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609273251" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/its-a-bad-idea" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3181609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609273251" alt="Its a Bad Idea" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3181609)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/its-a-bad-idea" >Its a Bad Idea</a></span> for helping me revise and edit this tale, and special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609273251" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span> for all that she does to help this community thrive. Have a wonderful New Year.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
