				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 18:57:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Sirslash47</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6438262</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This was my gift to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6284593&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="YellowISlol" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6284593)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" >YellowISlol</a></span> for the 2020 art-exchange.<br /> He asked for a thing on Josie and/or hot coco.</p> <p>I changed two tenses before I uploaded it. I don't think it makes a difference.</p> <p>Thanks to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/navimaster" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5839130&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="Navimaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5839130)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/navimaster" >Navimaster</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span> for critting this before I turned it in. I might have forgotten someone else, my apologies. Also thank to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6391595&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="Quadraginta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6391595)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" >Quadraginta</a></span> for the extra eyes after the reveal.</p> <p>Edit: I used the Christmas theme with snowflakes from <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/theme:xmas">here</a>. Credit to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dc-yerko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1780049&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="Dc_Yerko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1780049)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dc-yerko" >Dc_Yerko</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609271591" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> 
